    "title": "Find the Successor of a Node in Level Order Traversal",
    "category": "Trees",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given the root of a binary tree and a target node, determine the node that immediately follows the target in level order traversal. If no such node exists, print NONE.",
